\[
P_n(x) = \frac{1}{2^n \Gamma(n+1)} \frac{d^n}{dx^n} (x^n - 1)^n
\]
For \( n = 3 \), we have:
\[
P_3(x) = \frac{1}{2^3 \Gamma(3+1)} \frac{d^3}{dx^3} (x^3 - 1)^3
\]
Here, \( \Gamma(3+1) = \Gamma(4) = 3! = 6 \), so:
\[
P_3(x) = \frac{1}{8 \times 6} \frac{d^3}{dx^3} (x^3 - 1)^3 = \frac{1}{48} \frac{d^3}{dx^3} (x^3 - 1)^3
\]
