\]
For \( n = 3 \), we have:
\[
P_3(x) = \frac{1}{2^3 \Gamma(3+1)} \frac{d^3}{dx^3} (x^3 - 1)^3
\]
Here, \( \Gamma(3+1) = \Gamma(4) = 3! = 6 \), so:
\[
