\[
\Delta E \geq \frac{1}{2\Delta t}
\]

Given the lifetime \(\Delta t = 2.0 \times 10^{-23}\ \text{s}\), we can calculate the uncertainty in the energy:

\[
\Delta E \geq \frac{1}{2 \times 2.0 \times 10^{-23}\ \text{s}} = 0.25 \times 10^{-23}\ \text{s}^{-1}
\]

